stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: authorized
    q_check_auth --> q_revert: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_not_published: sale has ended
    q_check_ended --> q_revert: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_not_published --> q_set_details: TGE details not yet published
    q_check_not_published --> q_revert: revert AlreadyPublished
    q_set_details --> [*]: set askToken address, emit TgeDetailsPublished
    q_revert --> [*]: revert with error

    note right of q_set_details
        INV-001: askToken address set only at TGE publication (not at initialization)
        INV-002: TGE details are immutable once published
        INV-003: prerequisite for supplyTokens
    end note
